          "id": "90sh1781j5jp",
          "status": "scheduled",
          "body": "In order to increase the stability and scalability of our systems, we are performing scheduled maintenance on our Production database on Saturday, April 11, from 4PM-8PM PDT.\n\nDuring this time, incoming customer and Category Stats will be delayed in being written to the database, and metrics may lag as a result. Requests for category statistics may also be temporarily unavailable while we perform the maintenance.\n\nThank you for your patience through this maintenance.",
